  - m_Id: 44124330363761263
    m_Localized: "\u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 formed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761264
    m_Localized: "You joined the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761265
    m_Localized: "You left the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761266
    m_Localized: Promoted to Officer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761267
    m_Localized: Set back to Member.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761268
    m_Localized: "Removed from the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761269
    m_Localized: Vote counted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761270
    m_Localized: Ballot opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761271
    m_Localized: Vault registered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761272
    m_Localized: Invite code copied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761273
    m_Localized: "\u0412\u043E\u0439\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0441 \u043A\u043E\u0448\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E\u043C,
      \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u0443\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044C \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0439
      \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761274
    m_Localized: Something went wrong on our side. Try again in a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761275
    m_Localized: Could not reach the server. Showing what was last loaded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761276
    m_Localized: That request was not understood. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761277
    m_Localized: Too many tries. Wait a moment and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761278
    m_Localized: "Pick a \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 name of 1 to 32 characters."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761279
    m_Localized: Pick a tag of 1 to 5 characters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761280
    m_Localized: That join setting is not valid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761281
    m_Localized: "You are already in a \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433. Leave it first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761282
    m_Localized: Could not mint an invite code. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761283
    m_Localized: Your account is not set up yet. Try again in a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761284
    m_Localized: An invite code is six characters, letters and numbers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761285
    m_Localized: "No \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 uses that code."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761286
    m_Localized: "You are not in a \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761287
    m_Localized: "Someone else changed the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 first. Try again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761288
    m_Localized: Pick another member for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761289
    m_Localized: Only a leader or officer can do that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761290
    m_Localized: "That member is no longer in the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761291
    m_Localized: That member's role does not allow it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761292
    m_Localized: Someone changed that first. Refresh and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761293
    m_Localized: That tier is not valid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761294
    m_Localized: Those choices are not valid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761295
    m_Localized: That tier is still locked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761296
    m_Localized: A ballot is already open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761297
    m_Localized: That ballot no longer exists.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761298
    m_Localized: That ballot has closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761299
    m_Localized: Your Vigil weight could not be read. Try again in a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761300
    m_Localized: That is not a valid vault address.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761301
    m_Localized: That address is not a multisig.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761302
    m_Localized: The vault index must be between 0 and 255.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761303
    m_Localized: That vault has too many signers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761304
    m_Localized: "Only the \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 leader can register a vault."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761305
    m_Localized: A signer could not be accepted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761306
    m_Localized: "This \u041A\u0440\u0443\u0433 already has a vault."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761307
    m_Localized: The vault could not be read right now. Try again in a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44124330363761308
    m_Localized: Clear Rubble ({0} left)  +{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
